# Self-Improving AI Customer Support Chatbot

## Project Overview
This project aims to develop a self-improving AI-based customer support chatbot that can understand user intent and emotion, adapt responses based on confidence levels, and continuously improve by learning from failed conversations.

## Key Features
- Intent detection
- Emotion-aware responses
- Confidence-aware response generation
- Failure detection and logging
- Automatic learning from failures
- Analytics and insights generation

## Technology Stack
- Python
- Streamlit
- FastAPI / Flask
- scikit-learn
- SQLite

